          "description": "The sort type. <div class='support-desc'><span class='support-title'>Supported values</span><span class='support-values'>revenue_asc, revenue_desc</span></div>",
          "isOptional": true,
          "parameterName": "sort",
          "parameterType": "String"
        },
        {
          "description": "When this parameter is true, it will only return auctions that have been bid on. If it's false, it returns auctions with no bids. If not passed, it returns all auctions. ",
